# Playtest report — build `playtest-3`

**Build played:** release `playtest-3` in world/producer, `snake-playtest-3.zip` (game-developer 531454b + artist 766d875), served from `snake-pt3/` with `python3 -m http.server 8003`; also opened once via `file://`.
**How played:** headless Chromium (Playwright 1.64), real keyboard events in real time (Enter, Space, arrows, P, Esc, M), mouse click on Play again; 1280x800 plus 1366x768, 1024x600, 800x500, 1920x1080. State was read through `window.SnakeGame` to check numbers. Same scenarios as playtest-1 (see `report-playtest-1.md`). Evidence: `evidence/pt3/` (screenshots, logs, `run1-scripted.webm`, `run2-bot.webm`); scripts in `scripts/` (`pt3.py`, `bot3.py`, `t3b.py`, `long3.py`, `mute3.py`).

## Verdict
**Playable and completable, R1–R11 all work, and the playtest-1 defect is fixed: zero console errors/warnings, zero failed requests** (checked on a scripted run, on a 60 s bot run reaching score 36, and via `file://`). Art and sound are wired and consistent. Only minor items remain.

