| Req / item | Result |
|---|---|
| R1 | OK over http and `file://`, no page errors |
| R8 title | OK: pixel "SNAKE" logo + snake, how-to text, Start, "or press Enter / Space". Arrows/Esc on title do nothing |
| R2 / R3 | OK: one cell per ~120 ms tick; keypress → head turns within 64–112 ms (≤ one tick) |
